        "original_id": "55694f86-e54f-5778-9284-c6de9800947d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Double\n- Products: Blue, Dou3le, \"The Captain of Her Heart\", \"Woman of the World\", \"Rangoon Moon\", \"Devils Ball\"\n- Places: Europe, Switzerland\n- Topics: music releases, hit singles\n\nFacts:\n- Double was a Swiss music duo.\n- Blue included updated versions of Double's earlier singles \"Woman of the World\" and \"Rangoon Moon\".\n- \"The Captain of Her Heart\" was included on Blue.\n- \"The Captain of Her Heart\" was a plaintive, atmospheric, piano-led ballad.\n- \"The Captain of Her Heart\" was an immediate success throughout Europe when it was released as a single in 1986.\n- Double was best known for the hit single \"The Captain of Her Heart\".\n- \"Devils Ball\" is a song by Double.\n- \"Devils Ball\" was released as the lead single from Double's second studio album Dou3le.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
